{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34021","headline":"题支山南峰僧 · 皮日休","name":"题支山南峰僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云侵坏衲重隈肩，不下南峰不记年。\n池里羣鱼曾受戒，林间孤鹤欲参禅。\n鸡头竹上开危径，鸭脚花中擿废泉。\n无限吴都堪赏事，何如来此看师眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}